--- Scope ---

This license covers the TEMPLATE AS SHIPPED: the framework specification
(AGENTS.md), artifact templates (ARTIFACT-TEMPLATES.md), contribution
guidelines (CONTRIBUTING.md), and this license file. These define the
process framework --- its axioms, pipeline, protocols, roles, quality
gates, and compact rules as they exist in the original template.

This license does NOT cover and makes NO claim over:

  - Source code, tests, configurations, or any executable artifacts
    produced by projects that use this template
  - Project-specific content added to AGENTS.md during execution:
    resolved placeholder values, project-specific compact rules
    (PROJECT-{DOMAIN} blocks added during the Architect phase),
    phase state updates, or amendments introduced via Retrospective
  - Any file under docs/, src/, or other directories created by the
    pipeline during project execution
  - The products, services, or intellectual property built by
    following this framework

Projects created from this template are the sole property of their
creators, who may license them under any terms they choose. Using this
framework to build a product is like using Scrum to build a product:
the process guide has a copyright holder, the product does not inherit it.
